    749  f307							; TitleSequence — RETIRED 2026-10-19 (merged title screen). The space is
    750  f307							; fill; the old cross-bank entry was bank0 TitleSequenceFold (jsr → $F4C4,
    751  f307
    752  f307							; the jmp bytes are mirrored in this bank); tail exits jmp $FBF8 (ReturnPad)
    753  f307							; so the bank0 jsr returns. Runs once per frame from TitleIntro. No jsr
    754  f307							; inside (fold depth must not nest). Guard: DropTarget == $FD.
    755  f307							;   0 fly right→140	1 drop→48  2 face left  3 arm bomb (fuse 180)
    756  f307							;   4 walk→76 (screen center)  5 wait explosion  6 walk→20 (home)
    757  f307							;   7 pause 240 → reset to 0 (loop)
    758  f307							; Fuse/explosion countdown is OWNED here — TitleTailAudio skips BombTick on
    759  f307							; titles, so no walls/score/lives side effects can leak into title state.
