    869  f4e6		       d0 09		      bne	.SONotNothing
    870  f4e8							; No objects this frame: A = Temp = 0. Blank the sprite AND reset the
    871  f4e8							; flicker counter — with no objects the modulo below never runs, so
    872  f4e8							; FlickerFrame would grow unbounded and .SOModLoop (a subtract loop)
    873  f4e8							; would run O(FlickerFrame) iterations in the VBL on the next room with
    874  f4e8							; objects (measured +533c / +7 lines room-crossing spike, 2026-10-16).
    875  f4e8		       85 b4		      sta	FlickerFrame
